### IntelliJ (HTTP Client) ou VS Code (extension REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:8084

### 1. Enregistrer un relevé -> 201 (ou 202 si station-service est indisponible)
POST {{host}}/api/releves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationId": "1",
  "horodatage": "2026-11-09T10:00:00Z",
  "temperature": 22.4,
  "humidite": 61,
  "pression": 1014,
  "vitesseVent": 18,
  "precipitation": 0.2
}

### 2. Historique filtré par période
GET {{host}}/api/releves?stationId=1&from=2026-11-09T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-10T00:00:00Z&page=0&size=20

### 3. Derniers relevés (limite par défaut : 10)
GET {{host}}/api/releves/derniers?stationId=1&limite=5

### 4. Statistiques journalières (type : TEMPERATURE, HUMIDITE, PRESSION, VENT, PRECIPITATION)
GET {{host}}/api/releves/stats?stationId=1&date=2026-11-09&type=TEMPERATURE

### 5. Détail (remplacer l'id)
GET {{host}}/api/releves/REMPLACER_ID

### 6. Supprimer (remplacer l'id) -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/releves/REMPLACER_ID

### 7. Erreur : humidité invalide -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/releves
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stationId": "1", "horodatage": "2026-11-09T10:00:00Z", "temperature": 22.4, "humidite": 150, "pression": 1014, "vitesseVent": 18, "precipitation": 0.2 }
